{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attachChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"channel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Channel","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Channel"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Channel","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Channel"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The channel is registered locally and the server is notified on the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"refreshChannel(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (the “first-call”, carrying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_key"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"metadata"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which attaches the session and returns its id. There is no longer a dedicated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AttachChannel RPC — the lifecycle is consolidated onto RefreshChannel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(yorkie 0.7.10). Detach likewise needs no RPC: the server reclaims the session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via TTL once heartbeats stop."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/attachchannel(_:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"Yorkie","externalID":"s:6Yorkie6ClientC13attachChannelyAA0D0CAFYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"attachChannel"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Channel","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Channel","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC"}],"title":"attachChannel(_:)"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attachChannel"},{"type":"text","text":" attaches the given channel to this client."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/attachChannel(_:)"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client"]]},"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","type":"topic","title":"Yorkie"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Channel":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Channel"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a lightweight channel for presence and messaging."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Attachable"},{"type":"text","text":" so it can be managed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Attachment"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Channel","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Channel","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Channel","title":"Channel","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/channel"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client/attachChannel(_:)":{"type":"topic","title":"attachChannel(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/attachchannel(_:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attachChannel","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"Channel","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Channel","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie7ChannelC","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attachChannel"},{"text":" attaches the given channel to this client.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/attachChannel(_:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Client","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a normal client that can communicate with the server."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has documents and sends changes of the documents in local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to synchronize with other replicas in remote."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Client","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Client"}}}